{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52109","headline":"五言侍宴延庆殿同赋别题得寒桂丛应诏 · 长孙无忌","name":"五言侍宴延庆殿同赋别题得寒桂丛应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"根连八树里，枝拂九华端。\n风急小山外，叶下大江干。\n霜中花转馥，露上色逾丹。\n自负凌{夊/羊}性，岩幽待岁寒。\n（同前）（按：以上三首皆署「司徒赵国公臣长孙无忌上」。\n以上四首，张步云《唐代逸诗辑存》收入。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙无忌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52109.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52109","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}